{"steam_appid":1796790,"steam_name":"Chef RPG","trailer_hls":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/1796790/708947/3db273327f7a02453ac0bb8ac11e2db4de03051b/1750736895/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1717525487","trailer_thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257028094/movie.293x165.jpg?t=1717525487","screenshots":["https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1796790/ss_d0c5d57ea0d1f5e867d40790fe2589f462e8925d.1920x1080.jpg?t=1772310418","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1796790/ss_0e8f5c414197a2631fc57af714d9d1758120eefb.1920x1080.jpg?t=1772310418","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1796790/ss_6849dd366059065a76e0e0feacc2ac42401ba59d.1920x1080.jpg?t=1772310418","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1796790/ss_82871847df216baa534b10b5777cb4606a731d57.1920x1080.jpg?t=1772310418","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1796790/ss_b9175580e27f63693af78c04edcb8693a96290ce.1920x1080.jpg?t=1772310418"],"about_the_game":"You are a young chef who has been given the task of reviving Le Sequoia, a once famous restaurant in White Ash harbor. Begin your new life in this beautiful seaside town, which was once a thriving tourist destination. Hunt, harvest, and shop for ingredients. Along the way, befriend fascinating locals and help revive the town as a tourist hotspot. Craft your culinary adventure in this opened-ended RPG, where you can choose how to grow your restaurants. <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1796790/extras/6bc16384aced9a927be3973a3bf33a81.poster.avif?t=1772310418\" width=600 height=206 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1796790/extras/6bc16384aced9a927be3973a3bf33a81.webm?t=1772310418\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1796790/extras/6bc16384aced9a927be3973a3bf33a81.mp4?t=1772310418\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Will you become a master chef and create the most delicious dishes for your customers? Perhaps become a brave adventurer and impress your customers with rare ingredients? Or maybe, create a network of friends and grow your business through charisma and influence? The choice is yours.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1796790/extras/24b42930083c59c18a3652352677b058.avif?t=1772310418\" width=620 height=120 /></span><br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1796790/extras/8876910d26d847be78637c0db9c71cf4.avif?t=1772310418\" width=620 height=170 /></span>","requirements_minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS *:</strong> Windows 8 or greater<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 2.0GHz<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 2 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Direct X 9.0c compliant video card with 512 MB of RAM<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 5 GB available space</li></ul>","requirements_recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 2 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 5 GB available space</li></ul>","genres":["Adventure","RPG","Simulation","Early Access"],"developers":["World 2 Studio"],"publishers":["World 2 Studio"],"release_date":"12 Sep, 2024"}